    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d309">

                <pb facs="0416" n="348" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v01/pg348"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72/2416¾</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">8 March, 1916</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: Pray pardon me for not
                    having replied to this letter sooner.<anchor n="35" xml:id="d309-f1"/> I had
                    overlooked it.</p>
                <p>I quite agree with you that it would not be at all wise to act upon the
                    suggestion made by Mr. Lewis.</p>
                <p>Faithfully Yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. W.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
